  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-hotpink pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Dream Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/eb/Baku_H.png/revision/latest?cb=20151226010504\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Baku H\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/eb/Baku_H.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20151226010504\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/eb/Baku_H.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20151226010504 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/eb/Baku_H.png/revision/latest?cb=20151226010504 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Baku H\" width=\"270\" height=\"378\" data-image-key=\"Baku_H.png\" data-image-name=\"Baku H.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Baku (Valkyrie Crusade) can eat dreams.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb dreams.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"I hungered. And when I hunger, I feed. The dreams of your people were a very satisfying meal. Enough so that I did not need nourishment again for many years. Of course, once I was done, your people had no dreams left. But they, like the dreams themselves, were hardly to be missed.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Annona (Bionicle)</dd></dl></div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"They had this machine that stole our dreams.\"<br />\"Really?\"<br />\"Figuratively. Its name was Michael Eisner.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Buckle and Steve Smith (American Dad)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb dreams</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Dream_Manipulation\" title=\"Dream Manipulation\">Dream Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Dream_Replication\" title=\"Dream Replication\">Dream Replication</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDream_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Dream Eating/Consuming</li>\n<li>Dream/Nightmare Theft/Vampirism</li>\n<li>Nightmare Absorption</li>\n<li>Dream Energy Absorption</li>\n<li>Oneirovorous</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDream_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb/eat/steal dreams/nightmares of others, either storing them into some form, using them for various reasons (food, inspiration, power, etc.) or sharing/passing them on.\n</p><p>The effects of having one's dreams stolen vary greatly. Victims of dream theft may become unable to sleep properly, lose their creativity or even go completely insane. In some cases, there may not be any side effects at all, particularly if the dream is merely being shared or copied rather than completely removed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDream_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Absorption\" title=\"Emotion Absorption\">Emotion Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fear_Absorption\" title=\"Fear Absorption\">Fear Absorption</a>: of the nightmares.</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Insomnia_Inducement\" title=\"Insomnia Inducement\">Insomnia Inducement</a> (Varies)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Absorption\" title=\"Knowledge Absorption\">Knowledge Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Experience_Absorption\" title=\"Experience Absorption\">Experience Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Memory_Absorption\" title=\"Memory Absorption\">Memory Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Theft\" title=\"Talent Theft\">Talent Theft</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Psychic Energy Absorption\">Psychic Energy Absorption</a> (Dream energy)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDream_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Baku_Physiology\" title=\"Baku Physiology\">Baku Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dream_Manipulation\" title=\"Dream Manipulation\">Dream Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nightmare_Manipulation\" title=\"Nightmare Manipulation\">Nightmare Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Subconscious_Manipulation\" title=\"Subconscious Manipulation\">Subconscious Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDream_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Shield\" title=\"Psychic Shield\">Psychic Shield</a> are either immune or highly resistant.</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Shield\" title=\"Psychic Shield\">Psychic Shield</a> (highly resistant) and <a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Immunity\" title=\"Psychic Immunity\">Psychic Immunity</a> (impervious).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDream_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>See Also: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/DreamStealer\">Dream Stealer</a></i>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://bionicle.fandom.com/wiki/Annona\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bionicle:Annona\">Annona</a> (<i>Bionicle</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dannyphantom.fandom.com/wiki/Nocturn\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dannyphantom:Nocturn\">Nocturn</a> (<i>Danny Phantom</i>)</li>\n<li>Three Dream Stooges (<i>Final Fantasy VI</i>)</li>\n<li>Campari (<i>King of Bandit Jing</i>)</li>\n<li>Baku (<i>Japanese Folklore</i>)</li>\n<li>Doremy Sweet (<i>Touhou Project</i>)</li>\n<li>Drowzee, Hypno, and Darkrai (<i>Pokémon</i>)</li>\n<li>Pokémon (<i>Pokémon</i>); via Dream Eater</li>\n<li>Nightmares (<i>Arkwell Academy</i>)\n<ul><li>Bethany</li>\n<li>Dusty Everhart</li>\n<li>Nimue</li>\n<li>Moira Nimue-Everhart</li></ul></li>\n<li>Xiao (<i>Genshin Impact</i>)</li>\n<li>Twyla (<i>Monster High</i>)</li>\n<li>Baku (<i>Valkyrie Crusade</i>)</li>\n<li>Baku (<i>Yo-kai Watch</i>)</li>\n<li>Bakus (<i>Lost Girl</i>)</li>\n<li>Dreamcatcher (<i>Skylanders</i>)</li>\n<li>Dream Snatcher (<i>Power Rangers Megaforce</i>)</li>\n<li>Dream Eaters (<i>Kingdom Hearts: Dream Drop Distance</i>)</li>\n<li>Raven (<i>Teen Titans Go!</i>)</li>\n<li>Doremy Sweet (<i>Touhou Project</i>)</li>\n<li>Dream Butterfly (<i>Yashahime</i>)</li>\n<li>Hiruko (<i>Nightmare Inspector</i>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDream_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Dream Stone (<i>Mario &amp; Luigi: Dream Team</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://elderscrolls.fandom.com/wiki/Skull_of_Corruption_(Skyrim)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:elderscrolls:Skull of Corruption (Skyrim)\">Skull of Corruption</a> (<i>The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDream_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"a9ae2fdc9717fe76290969f87db13bcd\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Nocturn_reveals_true_self-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:139px; width:185px; top:23px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Nocturn_reveals_true_self.png\" title=\"Nocturn reveals true self.png (534 KB)\" style=\"height:139px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e4/Nocturn_reveals_true_self.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20190122044146\" title=\"Nocturn reveals true self.png (534 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Nocturn (Danny Phantom) the Ghost of Sleep and Dreams use special sleep helmets to convert it into dream energy, allowing him to absorb the dream energy to know what everyone was dreaming about or to make himself stronger and more powerful.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Nocturn reveals true self.png\" data-image-key=\"Nocturn_reveals_true_self.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Nocturn (Danny Phantom) the Ghost of Sleep and Dreams use special sleep helmets to convert it into dream energy, allowing him to absorb  the dream energy to know what everyone was dreaming about or to make himself stronger and more powerful.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Nocturn reveals true self.png (534 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Nocturn (Danny Phantom) the Ghost of Sleep and Dreams use special sleep helmets to convert it into dream energy, allowing him to absorb the dream energy to know what everyone was dreaming about or to make himself stronger and more powerful.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Nocturn reveals true self.png\" data-image-key=\"Nocturn_reveals_true_self.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Nocturn (Danny Phantom) the Ghost of Sleep and Dreams use special sleep helmets to convert it into dream energy, allowing him to absorb  the dream energy to know what everyone was dreaming about or to make himself stronger and more powerful.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e4/Nocturn_reveals_true_self.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20190122044146\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Nocturn (Danny Phantom) the Ghost of Sleep and Dreams use special sleep helmets to convert it into dream energy, allowing him to absorb  the dream energy to know what everyone was dreaming about or to make himself stronger and more powerful.</div></